Recommends: nemo | nautilus | dolphin | thunar
Description: Inspect Android APK package contents on Linux
 ApkManager is a native GTK 4 / Libadwaita desktop application for reading
 Android APK files. It lists raw archive contents instantly and uses Apktool
 to decode manifests, resources, and smali for deeper inspection.
 .
 A pinned Apktool JAR is bundled. Java 17+ is required for decode operations;
 raw archive listing works without Java.
